-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"刚做完保俶塔，还在想怎么把白塔做出来","body":"刚做完保俶塔，还在想怎么把白塔做出来","url":"https://m.okjike.com/reposts/6b086601320fd7e1b5871d37","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lt-f6B-vgXjnEU3k6BGAazzb6nRZv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T01:01:53+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:08:37+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lt-f6B-vgXjnEU3k6BGAazzb6nRZv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":{"handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","text":"钱弘俶的白塔，和钱弘佐的石像。\n\n闸门白塔是仅次于龙兴寺经幢的整个杭州地面古建里最老的东西，建于 957 年。就在钱塘江畔，是杭州近千年的交通地标。\n\n慈云寺石窟造像，建于 942 年，离白塔不远，就在玉皇山下。也是杭州最古老的造像之一，比多数飞来峰的造像要古。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/users/BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF"},"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false,"feed_order":16},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b078ec5136b2761c600f266","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"这是我一个没学过高数的人该看的东西么？","body":"这是我一个没学过高数的人该看的东西么？","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b078ec5136b2761c600f266","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lhJyrpt4wLWyXje38MqlHaW__yqHv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:33+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:08:37+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"http